        "confidence": "s",
        "reason": "Text \u0027CH\u00CDNH PH\u1EE4 ________\u0027 appears to be a document title or masthead (likely \u0027CH\u00CDNH PH\u1EE6\u0027 truncated or specific document header). It is the first node and semantically encompasses the entire regulation."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-aca084dc03ba6e31",
        "parent": "SN-d53681cb67def23d",
        "proposedLevel": 2,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027NGH\u1ECA \u0110\u1ECANH\u0027 (Decree) is a standard section in Vietnamese legal documents indicating the type of instrument. It sits under the main title but above the Chapters/Articles."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-fa3e46e19d6d0375",
        "parent": "SN-aca084dc03ba6e31",
        "proposedLevel": 3,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng I\u0027 (Chapter I) is a major structural division of the decree. It logically follows the Decree identifier and precedes the General Provisions."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-2ddcbcfd14c02240",
        "parent": "SN-fa3e46e19d6d0375",
        "proposedLevel": 4,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027QUY \u0110\u1ECANH CHUNG\u0027 (General Provisions) is the title of Chapter I. It contains the initial articles defining scope, objects, and terms."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-a34a97ca83b456e6",
        "parent": "SN-2ddcbcfd14c02240",
        "proposedLevel": 5,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027\u0110i\u1EC1u 1\u0027 (Article 1) is a sub-section within General Provisions. It defines the scope of adjustment."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-ad0f647090b35dae",
        "parent": "SN-2ddcbcfd14c02240",
        "proposedLevel": 5,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027\u0110i\u1EC1u 2\u0027 (Article 2) is a sibling to Article 1, also within General Provisions. It defines the applicable objects."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-2a07dbe2240718e3",
        "parent": "SN-2ddcbcfd14c02240",
        "proposedLevel": 5,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027\u0110i\u1EC1u 3\u0027 (Article 3) is a sibling to Articles 1 and 2, within General Provisions. It provides definitions."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-1767abb75196945e",
        "parent": "SN-2ddcbcfd14c02240",
        "proposedLevel": 5,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027\u0110i\u1EC1u 4\u0027 (Article 4) is a sibling article within General Provisions, discussing the legal value of shared data."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-35572ea4edd05ce3",
