        "proposedLevel": 5,
        "confidence": "high",
        "reason": "\u0027\u0110i\u1EC1u 5\u0027 (Article 5) is a sibling article within General Provisions, outlining general principles for management and sharing."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "SN-7e35948f55ab193e",
